# CRC Pattern - Construct - Reduce - Convert

## The Answer

```elixir
42

```

## Functional Core

```elixir
defmodule Counter do
  # Construct

  def new(input) do
    String.to_integer(input)
  end

  # Reduce

  def add(acc, number) do
    acc + number
  end

  # Convert

  def show(acc) do
    "The ants arrrrrr be #{acc}"
  end
end
```

## Pipe

```elixir
input = "42"

```

```elixir
import Counter

input
|> new()
|> add(1)
|> add(1)
|> add(-1)
|> show()
```
